{"id":"c93de624aafb760b","group":"58","path":"58/batch11/58-lem-ideal-normalness.md","title":"Ideal Normalness","display":"lem-ideal-normalness — Ideal Normalness","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-lem-ideal-normalness","aliases":["58-lem-ideal-normalness"],"display":"lem-ideal-normalness — Ideal Normalness","depends_on":["[[../batch05/58-df-ideal.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md]]","[[../batch09/58-df-powerset.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-lem-ideal-normalness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-lem-ideal-normalness</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-ideal-normalness — Ideal Normalness"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6e4f95381faac4f9\" href=\"?note=6e4f95381faac4f9\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-ideal.md\">../batch05/58-df-ideal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0fbfc19800246e77\" href=\"?note=0fbfc19800246e77\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md\">../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2b6b1d9eb78a2714\" href=\"?note=2b6b1d9eb78a2714\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-powerset.md\">../batch09/58-df-powerset.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> (regular uncountable cardinal), <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\kappa)\">\\(I\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\kappa)\\)</span> (proper ideal), and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\subseteq\\kappa\">\\(S\\subseteq\\kappa\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec A\">\\(\\vec A\\)</span> (set-coded sequence of members of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ideal},\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S,\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ideal},\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S,\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (upstream predicates)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}ideal\\text{-}normalness}\\vdash\\;&amp;\n\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Ideal}(I,\\mathcal P(\\kappa))\\land\\kappa\\notin I\\land\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\n\\land\\forall\\alpha&lt;\\kappa\\;(\\alpha\\in I)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\vec A\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec A,\\kappa,I)\n\\to\\{\\alpha\\in\\kappa:\\exists\\xi\\in\\alpha\\;(\\alpha\\in\\vec A(\\xi))\\}\\in I\\Bigr)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\to\\forall S\\subseteq\\kappa\\;\\forall f\\;\\Bigl(\n\\bigl(S\\notin I\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,S,\\kappa)\n\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in S\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;(f(\\alpha)&lt;\\alpha)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{8em}\\to\\exists\\beta&lt;\\kappa\\;\\bigl(\\{\\alpha\\in S:f(\\alpha)=\\beta\\}\\notin I\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}ideal\\text{-}normalness}\\vdash\\;&amp;\n\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Ideal}(I,\\mathcal P(\\kappa))\\land\\kappa\\notin I\\land\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\n\\land\\forall\\alpha&lt;\\kappa\\;(\\alpha\\in I)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\vec A\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec A,\\kappa,I)\n\\to\\{\\alpha\\in\\kappa:\\exists\\xi\\in\\alpha\\;(\\alpha\\in\\vec A(\\xi))\\}\\in I\\Bigr)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\to\\forall S\\subseteq\\kappa\\;\\forall f\\;\\Bigl(\n\\bigl(S\\notin I\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,S,\\kappa)\n\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in S\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;(f(\\alpha)&lt;\\alpha)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{8em}\\to\\exists\\beta&lt;\\kappa\\;\\bigl(\\{\\alpha\\in S:f(\\alpha)=\\beta\\}\\notin I\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The displayed diagonal-union closure is quantified over set-coded <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>-sequences; together with bounded sets belonging to <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span>, it is the normal-ideal hypothesis.</li>\n<li>The conclusion is the correct ideal form of Fodor's lemma: every regressive map on an <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span>-positive set has an <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span>-positive fiber.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch05/58-df-ideal.md","status":"resolved","id":"6e4f95381faac4f9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-ideal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"0fbfc19800246e77","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-powerset.md","status":"resolved","id":"2b6b1d9eb78a2714","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-powerset.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"I\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\kappa)","display":false},{"tex":"S\\subseteq\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec A","display":false},{"tex":"I","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ideal},\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S,\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}ideal\\text{-}normalness}\\vdash\\;&\n\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Ideal}(I,\\mathcal P(\\kappa))\\land\\kappa\\notin I\\land\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\n\\land\\forall\\alpha<\\kappa\\;(\\alpha\\in I)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall\\vec A\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec A,\\kappa,I)\n\\to\\{\\alpha\\in\\kappa:\\exists\\xi\\in\\alpha\\;(\\alpha\\in\\vec A(\\xi))\\}\\in I\\Bigr)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&\\to\\forall S\\subseteq\\kappa\\;\\forall f\\;\\Bigl(\n\\bigl(S\\notin I\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,S,\\kappa)\n\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in S\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;(f(\\alpha)<\\alpha)\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\hspace{8em}\\to\\exists\\beta<\\kappa\\;\\bigl(\\{\\alpha\\in S:f(\\alpha)=\\beta\\}\\notin I\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"I","display":false},{"tex":"I","display":false},{"tex":"I","display":false}],"bytes":1652,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3905","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-lem-ideal-normalness.md|58-lem-ideal-normalness]]（batch11）"}],"outgoing":["6e4f95381faac4f9","0fbfc19800246e77","2b6b1d9eb78a2714","36d7463d215be751"]}